## Scene 1

[[FSE PRESET jack pos=-1.3,0 facing=dsc; PRESET cecily pos=-0.6,0 facing=dsc; PRESET gwendolen pos=3,-0.5 facing=270; PRESET algernon pos=1.5,1.6 facing=180; PRESET lane pos=2.2,1.8 facing=200; PRESET cigarette-case with=algernon; PRESET diary with=gwendolen]]

